concepts.configurationRelevance:
Complete nftables Configuration Script:
table inet filter {
    chain forward {
        type filter hook forward priority 0; policy drop;
        ct state established,related counter accept
        iifname "eth1" oifname "eth0" ip daddr 10.231.30.10 tcp dport 80 counter accept
        counter log prefix "[NFT-DENIED]: " drop
    }
}

CLI Commands:
nft list ruleset
nft reset counters
nft monitor
